          <vector>
        a [funnel-step] label="Show the 2 people who reached checkout_completed" href=/_leptoskit/admin/analytics/actors?back=%2F_leptoskit%2Fadmin%2Fanalytics%2Ffunnels%3Ffrom%3D2026-10-05%26order%3Dordered%26s0%3Dcheckout_started%26s1%3Dpayment_submitted%26s2%3Dcheckout_completed%26to%3D2026-11-02%26window%3D14&amp;q=%7B%22query%22%3A%7B%22kind%22%3A%22funnels%22%2C%22range%22%3A%7B%22from%22%3A%222026-10-05T00%3A00%3A00Z%22%2C%22to%22%3A%222026-11-02T00%3A00%3A00Z%22%7D%2C%22steps%22%3A%5B%22checkout_started%22%2C%22payment_submitted%22%2C%22checkout_completed%22%5D%2C%22window_seconds%22%3A1209600%2C%22order%22%3A%22ordered%22%7D%2C%22point%22%3A%7B%22point%22%3A%22funnel_step%22%2C%22step%22%3A3%7D%2C%22limit%22%3A50%2C%22offset%22%3A0%7D
        "3. checkout_completed"
aside [drawer-aside] label="Workings"
  div [drawer:funnels] label="Workings: checkout_started → checkout_completed · Funnels insight · live"
    "Workings"
    "checkout_started → checkout_completed · Funnels insight · live"
    div [drawer-changed] role=status
    button [workings-close] label="Close workings (W)"
      "Close"
    div [drawer-scroll]
      div [station:emit]
        div [station-dot]
        div [station-head]
          "Emit"
          "the event catalogue"
        button [station-toggle] label="Emit station"
        div [station-body]
          "checkout_started"
          "is a Rust type in your app, so its properties are its fields and a misspelled one fails when it compiles. This is the shape the app last registered; the service doesn't record where in your code it's sent from."
          div [code]
            div [code-head]
              "Rust"
              button [copy] label="Copy as Rust"
                "Copy"
            div [code-line]
              "1"
              span [code-text]
                "#[derive(Event)]"
            div [code-line]
              "2"
              span [code-text]
                "struct"
                "CheckoutStarted"
                "{"
            div [code-line]
              "3"
              span [code-text]
                "plan"
                ":"
                "String"
                ","
            div [code-line]
              "4"
              span [code-text]
                "seats"
                ":"
                "u32"
                ","
            div [code-line]
              "5"
              span [code-text]
                "}"
      div [station:send]
        div [station-dot]
        div [station-head]
          "Send"
          "the latest checkout_started, re-encoded here"
        button [station-toggle] label="Send station"
        div [station-body]
          "Typed events send no property names, so this one is 92 bytes instead of 209: 56.0% smaller. Measured as one event alone in a batch; a real batch shares its context and session between events, so it shrinks further."
          div [code]
            div [code-head]
              button [copy] label="Copy as text"
                "Copy"
            div [code-line]
              "1"
              span [code-text]
                "typed"
                ","
                "positional"
                "92"
                "bytes"
            div [code-line]
              "2"
              span [code-text]
                "JSON"
                ","
                "named"
                "209"
                "bytes"
            div [code-line]
              "3"
              span [code-text]
            div [code-line]
              "4"
              span [code-text]
                "//"
                "values"
                "in"
                "field"
                "order"
                ":"
                "pro"
                ","
                "2"
      div [station:store]
        div [station-dot]
        div [station-head]
          "Store"
          "events, person_distinct_ids, person_overrides on sqlite"
        button [station-toggle] label="Store station"
        div [station-body]
          "Events land in"
          "events"
          "as they arrive; sessions and persons are kept up to date beside them as each batch is stored, so a query reads tables, never a queue. These are the ones this query read."
          div [code]
            div [code-head]
              button [copy] label="Copy as text"
                "Copy"
            div [code-line]
              "1"
              span [code-text]
                "events"
            div [code-line]
              "2"
              span [code-text]
                "uuid"
                "BLOB"
            div [code-line]
              "3"
              span [code-text]
                "name"
                "TEXT"
            div [code-line]
              "4"
              span [code-text]
                "distinct_id"
                "TEXT"
            div [code-line]
              "5"
              span [code-text]
                "person_id"
                "BLOB"
            div [code-line]
              "6"
              span [code-text]
                "timestamp"
                "TEXT"
            div [code-line]
              "7"
              span [code-text]
                "received_at"
                "TEXT"
            div [code-line]
              "8"
              span [code-text]
                "session_id"
                "BLOB"
            div [code-line]
              "9"
              span [code-text]
                "context_id"
                "INTEGER"
            div [code-line]
              "10"
              span [code-text]
                "properties"
                "TEXT"
            div [code-line]
              "11"
              span [code-text]
                "source"
                "INTEGER"
            div [code-line]
              "12"
              span [code-text]
            div [code-line]
              "13"
              span [code-text]
                "person_distinct_ids"
            div [code-line]
              "14"
              span [code-text]
                "distinct_id"
                "TEXT"
            div [code-line]
              "15"
              span [code-text]
                "person_id"
                "BLOB"
            div [code-line]
              "16"
              span [code-text]
                "created_at"
                "TEXT"
            div [code-line]
              "17"
              span [code-text]
            div [code-line]
              "18"
              span [code-text]
                "person_overrides"
            div [code-line]
              "19"
              span [code-text]
                "distinct_id"
                "TEXT"
            div [code-line]
              "20"
              span [code-text]
                "person_id"
                "BLOB"
            div [code-line]
              "21"
              span [code-text]
                "created_at"
                "TEXT"
      div [station:ask]
        div [station-dot]
        div [station-head]
          "Ask"
          "the query"
        button [station-toggle] label="Ask station"
        div [station-body]
          "Every insight is one value of the typed"
          "Query"
          "enum. The SQL is what it became. It ran 1 statement on sqlite in <n> ms. Change the builder and these lines change with it."
          div role=tablist label="Ask as"
            button [ask-tab:rust] role=tab
              "Rust"
            button [ask-tab:sql] role=tab
              "SQL"
            button [ask-tab:http] role=tab
              "HTTP"
          div [ask-panel:rust] role=tabpanel
            div [code]
              div [code-head]
                "Rust"
                button [copy] label="Copy as Rust"
                  "Copy"
              div [code-line]
                "1"
                span [code-text]
                  "use"
                  "leptoskit_analytics"
                  ":"
                  ":"
                  "query"
                  ":"
                  ":"
                  "*;"
              div [code-line]
                "2"
                span [code-text]
              div [code-line]
                "3"
                span [code-text]
                  "let"
                  "query"
                  "="
                  "Query"
                  ":"
                  ":"
                  "Funnels(FunnelsQuery"
                  "{"
              div [code-line]
                "4"
                span [code-text]
                  "range"
